		{$Common.Block1}
		      {$Common.BlockFalloff}
		■ Magic conversion: All damage and projectiles converted to magic damage
		■ Defense penetration: 30% defense penetration
		■ Unblocked bonus: +12% damage vs unblocked targets
		■ Blocked vulnerability: +10% damage taken on blocked targets
